1
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,539 --> 00:01:37,950
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,160
What are you thinking about?

4
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,920
This river—

5
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,920
it looks like an old man.

6
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,920
It must have many stories.

7
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,190
Thank you

8
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,840
for saving me again.

9
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,720
Are you really from the NBIS?

10
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,400
Here.

11
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,870
This is the best I have.

12
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,490
It's very sweet.

13
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:58,960
Thank you for the scarf.

14
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,720
Comrade Su Causeway,

15
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,560
we finally meet officially.

16
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,030
Yes.

17
00:03:16,230 --> 00:03:17,470
You are much prettier

18
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:19,470
than in the photo.

19
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:26,790
Chen Kailai already made me
look really good in the photo.

20
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:29,440
It wasn't taken by Chen Kailai.

21
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,190
It's another one.

22
00:03:33,710 --> 00:03:34,630
At that time,

23
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,280
you were still called Su Chuanghan.

24
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,310
Leifeng Pagoda told me.

25
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,870
He always kept your photo

26
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,710
in his wallet.

27
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,150
Su Chuanghan...

28
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,870
No one has called me that for a long time.

29
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:11,520
It's good that you didn't lose each other.

30
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:16,800
Now we are just comrades.

31
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:19,519
And you...

32
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:20,950
are his wife.

33
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:25,720
Being a comrade is work.

34
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,630
Being his wife...

35
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,600
is also work.

36
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,750
If you love him,

37
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:38,330
being his wife can be more than just work.

38
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,560
The word 'love'

39
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:45,310
is too much of a luxury for me.

40
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,330
It's the same for me.

41
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:55,000
I just want everyone to stay alive.

42
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,310
Yes.

43
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:05,670
Staying alive is the most important thing.

44
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:11,080
Thank you for saving me more than once.

45
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,630
Protecting you is my duty.

46
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,510
And thank you

47
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:18,710
for rescuing Ou Yang.

48
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:20,510
Leifeng Pagoda and I

49
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:22,970
will fully cooperate with you
in the future.

50
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:26,530
We will welcome
the day of victory together.

51
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,490
And Broken Bridge.

52
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:34,760
I almost forgot him.

53
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,600
This brat

54
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:39,680
might outlive us all.

55
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:57,330
Impressive, General.

56
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,510
Continue!

57
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,450
I lost.

58
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,590
Director Li,

59
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:30,920
you must remember

60
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:35,430
that the Nanjing government
saved you this time.

61
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,800
General, it was my negligence on duty.

62
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,430
You are quite a loyal dog.

63
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,430
If piercing my chest

64
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,240
with this sword can relieve your anger,

65
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:17,950
please do it.

66
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,510
You?

67
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,600
You are not worthy of that yet.

68
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:34,830
It's yours now.

69
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,560
Director Li,

70
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,720
you must remember

71
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:42,920
that I defeated you

72
00:07:43,570 --> 00:07:44,740
using this sword.

73
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:49,310
Watch yourself from now on.

74
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:08,000
These Japanese.

75
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:11,950
I already have my hands full
cleaning up their messes.

76
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,190
But now,

77
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,400
we are caught in the middle,

78
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,760
so we can only endure.

79
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,860
Complaints aside,

80
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,390
we still

81
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,400
have to run errands for them.

82
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:31,510
Director.

83
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,940
What exactly is Project Slumber?

84
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,480
The Japanese seem to value it highly,

85
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,740
but they won't tell us.

86
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,669
Some things

87
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,820
are better left

88
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,360
unknown.

89
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:02,920
Try this.

90
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,290
It's not strong enough.

91
00:09:19,250 --> 00:09:21,780
It's not that the liquor
isn't strong enough.

92
00:09:22,170 --> 00:09:25,430
It's that the fire in your heart
is too strong to be quelled.

93
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,870
If you hadn't told me my cousin was fine,

94
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,530
I would have thought she...

95
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,440
She risked her life

96
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:46,890
to participate in the operation.

97
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,560
Next time there's
such a dangerous operation,

98
00:09:54,660 --> 00:09:55,940
can you let me in?

99
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:01,810
Are you prepared to sacrifice yourself?

100
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,310
We have different roles.

101
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:19,960
Our superiors assign tasks

102
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,400
based on everyone's strengths.

103
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,760
We are not afraid of sacrifice,

104
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,400
but we can't make meaningless sacrifices.

105
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:36,600
Do you know

106
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:39,720
why we trust you,

107
00:10:40,510 --> 00:10:41,570
Jinbao trusts you,

108
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,990
and Du Huangqiao trusts you?

109
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:50,230
Your eyes.

110
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:55,400
Because there's no calculation
in your eyes.

111
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,530
Isn't that just being stupid?

112
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,500
You're not stupid.

113
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,290
It's called sincerity.

114
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,880
Sincerity is the easiest disguise
for deception.

115
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,170
Does it work?

116
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,670
Of course.

117
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:20,040
It's very powerful.

118
00:11:38,390 --> 00:11:39,390
We worked so hard,

119
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,840
but it was all in vain.

120
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,080
Besides Chen,

121
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,750
I really can't think of

122
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:48,550
anyone else
who would leak Ishida's information.

123
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:53,350
He wasn't the one who sold us out.

124
00:11:56,850 --> 00:11:59,270
The Communists had deployed people
at the hospital in advance.

125
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:01,400
They obviously got the news before us.

126
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,780
We were outsmarted this time.

127
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,240
If Chen Kailai and Du Huangqiao

128
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,270
were on the same side as you suspect,

129
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,170
we would have been caught long ago.

130
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:12,930
That's true.

131
00:12:15,490 --> 00:12:17,420
But having someone like him around

132
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,000
makes me uneasy.

133
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:23,290
I still have use for him later.

134
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,250
What use could he be?

135
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:29,380
Du Huangqiao trusts him.

136
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:33,130
We can get a lot of intelligence
through him.

137
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:35,620
I'm afraid
you won't be able to control him.

138
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,690
He'll be mine sooner or later.

139
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,380
Have a seat.

140
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:35,800
Although we've met individually,

141
00:13:36,510 --> 00:13:37,630
this is the first time the three of us

142
00:13:37,630 --> 00:13:39,890
are meeting under these circumstances.

143
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,680
The Three Sights of West Lake

144
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,580
is only missing one piece.

145
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,780
Broken Bridge is a new member.

146
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:50,820
There's no need
to reveal my identity to him for now.

147
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:54,810
Ou Yang has safely arrived in Yan'an.

148
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:00,510
Ms. Ou Yang.

149
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,160
Thank you.

150
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,400
Thank you for joining us.

151
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:07,320
I will have someone arrange for you

152
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,720
to go to the Soviet Union
as soon as possible

153
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,780
to participate in vaccine research.

154
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:14,000
I left Hoshino's lab a long time ago.

155
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:16,170
I don't know his current progress.

156
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:18,550
If we want to develop
an effective vaccine,

157
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:20,880
I'm afraid we'll need the latest samples.

158
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,940
Our superiors notified us

159
00:14:26,670 --> 00:14:29,600
that we must get
Hoshino's latest research samples.

160
00:14:31,630 --> 00:14:32,630
Do you have a plan?

161
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:41,750
The superiors want to send someone
to infiltrate Hoshino's lab.

162
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:47,750
I'll go.

163
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:52,200
I speak Japanese and studied medicine.

164
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,130
I'm the best fit.

165
00:14:53,550 --> 00:14:55,210
You've already been exposed.

166
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,210
The risk is too high.

167
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,630
Only Japanese people

168
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,630
can enter the lab.

169
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,720
Hoshino doesn't know me.

170
00:15:03,150 --> 00:15:04,150
True. I checked.

171
00:15:05,510 --> 00:15:06,720
The security of Hoshino's lab

172
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,440
is handled by the Plum Blossom Agency.

173
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,960
No. 76 is not involved.

174
00:15:10,750 --> 00:15:13,480
But bringing Su Causeway in does carry
the risk of exposing her identity.

175
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,810
The mission can't wait.

176
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,370
I'm the best fit right now.

177
00:15:17,670 --> 00:15:19,870
Have you two already made an agreement?

178
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,630
The situation is urgent.

179
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:26,630
There is no better candidate than me.

180
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:27,630
That's an excuse!

181
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,980
If it's the superiors' decision,

182
00:15:38,510 --> 00:15:39,240
I will obey.

183
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:52,780
I will request further instructions
from the superiors.

184
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:55,770
Comrade Su Causeway
can start preparing for now.

185
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,840
Before the operation...

186
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,250
you need to undergo some training.

187
00:16:01,510 --> 00:16:02,270
I can do it.

188
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,630
Don't worry.

189
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,840
I will send you to

190
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,910
a safer place.

191
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,720
Okay.

192
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,520
The car is right outside.

193
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:26,100
I'll be waiting for you in the car.

194
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,210
Why do I feel like we just met

195
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,760
and we're already parting ways?

196
00:17:13,819 --> 00:17:15,670
I thought you were used to it.

197
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,210
Do you have any liquor here?

198
00:17:24,369 --> 00:17:25,280
I want a drink.

199
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:29,440
No.

200
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:34,480
I remember
you used to never be without a drink.

201
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,200
I suddenly feel

202
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,600
that liquor doesn't taste as good anymore.

203
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:49,960
In Fengxian,

204
00:17:51,180 --> 00:17:52,620
I rented an apiary.

205
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,880
When the rapeseed flowers bloom,

206
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,340
I can go harvest the honey.

207
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:05,110
You must call me when it's harvest time.

208
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,640
I love honey.

209
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:19,680
Have you thought about the future?

210
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:20,830
I mean...

211
00:18:22,010 --> 00:18:23,050
after we win.

212
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:27,480
I have.

213
00:18:31,310 --> 00:18:32,510
When that time comes,

214
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:36,510
I'll go back to my hometown
and have a few acres of land.

215
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:39,440
I'll plant chestnut trees all over

216
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:42,490
and keep a few beehives.

217
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,720
Then I'll have

218
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:48,510
endless chestnuts and honey.

219
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:02,550
Take care.

220
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,750
You too.

221
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,760
The expert is already on the way.

222
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:21,020
This is your temporary place to stay.

223
00:21:23,790 --> 00:21:25,450
Sorry to put you through this.

224
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,030
Not at all.

225
00:21:29,590 --> 00:21:30,680
Since I left home,

226
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,400
my address

227
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,450
has been changing constantly.

228
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,540
I've lived in all kinds of places.

229
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:44,300
At least this place looks like a home.

230
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,510
Do you want a home?

231
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:52,830
Yes.

232
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:55,720
Sometimes I really do.

233
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:54,830
Whiskey.

234
00:22:59,830 --> 00:23:00,760
I quit drinking.

235
00:23:01,470 --> 00:23:02,600
Swiss chewing gum

236
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:05,210
is very effective for quitting drinking.

237
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,240
You can try it too.

238
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:09,720
Can you really quit?

239
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:20,070
Playing another role every day,

240
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,840
guarding against everyone around you,

241
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:34,510
and facing unexpected events all the time—

242
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,510
living such a life,

243
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,140
can you really quit drinking?

244
00:23:44,230 --> 00:23:45,080
I know.

245
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,410
You have it harder than I do.

246
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:53,530
Because you're the one
making the decisions.

247
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,920
Just like back then,

248
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:05,010
when I decided to leave

249
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,460
and go to France alone.

250
00:24:11,820 --> 00:24:14,220
Is that where you joined the Organization?

251
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:15,470
Yes.

252
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,460
At that time, I thought

253
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,720
we would never see each other again.

254
00:24:59,110 --> 00:25:00,960
So you gave me this lighter.

255
00:25:40,550 --> 00:25:41,350
One day,

256
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:44,400
we dreamed we were dear to each other.

257
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:46,880
But I woke up

258
00:25:48,210 --> 00:25:50,410
to find that we were already strangers.

259
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:01,280
Actually, the morning I received the gift,

260
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,750
I had just met my recruiter

261
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:07,580
and officially joined the Party.

262
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:14,910
We didn't become strangers,

263
00:26:16,270 --> 00:26:18,680
but we became traitors working for No. 76.

264
00:26:35,880 --> 00:26:38,080
I'm returning it to its rightful owner.

265
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,960
Things given away

266
00:26:47,030 --> 00:26:48,440
cannot be taken back.

267
00:26:50,110 --> 00:26:52,400
It's just a gift between old friends.

268
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:02,310
School days were good.

269
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,640
Now,

270
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:06,650
it is also good.

271
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:16,010
It's not easy
for two people to come together.

272
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,200
There are some things

273
00:27:19,230 --> 00:27:20,760
you should tell her sooner.

274
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,370
I'll tell her when she returns safely.

275
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:37,740
She said she wanted a home.

276
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:43,270
I hope...

277
00:27:49,030 --> 00:27:50,440
I hope to see the two of you

278
00:27:51,350 --> 00:27:52,410
have that someday.

279
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,610
Definitely.

280
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:19,640
Get in.

281
00:28:21,110 --> 00:28:22,170
Where are we going?

282
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:44,550
Are you treating me to my last meal?

283
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:49,310
Good wine is worth seeking out.

284
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,440
Come on in.

285
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:05,640
Come on.

286
00:29:06,750 --> 00:29:07,440
Come on in.

287
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:08,200
Have a seat.

288
00:29:10,240 --> 00:29:11,480
Make yourself at home.

289
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,880
Don't stand on ceremony.

290
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:16,200
Come on, sit.

291
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:18,830
Have some tea.

292
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:24,030
Sit here for a bit.

293
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:26,180
I'll go get the dishes.

294
00:29:47,950 --> 00:29:49,430
Here come the dishes!

295
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:52,750
Here.

296
00:29:52,770 --> 00:29:54,370
I didn't know you could cook.

297
00:29:55,070 --> 00:29:55,870
Wait a minute.

298
00:29:56,270 --> 00:29:58,270
Guess what else is on the menu.

299
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,240
I have no idea.

300
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:18,480
This is your favorite,

301
00:30:19,830 --> 00:30:21,030
Yangzhou fried rice.

302
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,030
Did you make it?

303
00:30:31,750 --> 00:30:32,550
Don't rush.

304
00:30:33,950 --> 00:30:36,550
You haven't seen
the most important thing yet.

305
00:31:23,510 --> 00:31:25,310
If I had known you were this good,

306
00:31:25,830 --> 00:31:27,890
I might not have helped you back then.

307
00:31:35,070 --> 00:31:36,400
Who exactly are you?

308
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:42,070
Du Huangqiao, the former commander
of the 3rd Battalion, 5th Regiment,

309
00:31:42,070 --> 00:31:43,000
145th Division.

310
00:31:47,350 --> 00:31:48,240
What about now?

311
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,920
Now I'm your protector.

312
00:32:00,270 --> 00:32:03,070
You saved me
when I was in trouble back then.

313
00:32:06,570 --> 00:32:08,100
I just want to keep you safe.

314
00:32:20,070 --> 00:32:21,960
But that day I clearly saw

315
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:24,810
people from No. 76 drag your body away.

316
00:32:26,030 --> 00:32:27,760
The shoe was left on the ground.

317
00:32:39,590 --> 00:32:40,960
How could you lie to me?

318
00:32:42,510 --> 00:32:46,120
I was going to save you for last.

319
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:06,420
I really regret saving you back then.

320
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,030
I told you,

321
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,790
you are family.

322
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:22,370
I will give you one more chance to choose.

323
00:33:48,350 --> 00:33:50,040
If you think you were foolish enough

324
00:33:50,040 --> 00:33:52,170
to get involved with a traitorous dog,

325
00:33:53,120 --> 00:33:54,310
then shoot me.

326
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,600
But I just don't understand.

327
00:34:56,989 --> 00:34:59,470
How did you get so lucky in love?

328
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,680
This is what they say:

329
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:04,710
"Heaven never seals off all exits."

330
00:35:06,110 --> 00:35:07,190
I, Du Huangqiao,

331
00:35:08,110 --> 00:35:09,590
didn't die in Nanjing,

332
00:35:10,690 --> 00:35:12,090
nor did I die in Shanghai.

333
00:35:12,350 --> 00:35:13,550
Not only did I not die,

334
00:35:17,260 --> 00:35:18,380
but I also got a son.

335
00:35:18,770 --> 00:35:20,170
Who said it's a son?

336
00:35:21,670 --> 00:35:23,670
I'm sure it's a girl.

337
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,400
I even made pink clothes.

338
00:35:25,590 --> 00:35:27,230
Good, a girl is even better.

339
00:35:29,450 --> 00:35:31,450
Speaking of clothes, wait a moment.

340
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:32,470
Be careful.

341
00:35:32,470 --> 00:35:33,150
Be careful.

342
00:35:38,870 --> 00:35:40,850
I had this made at

343
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,860
Wang Xingchang Woolen Suit Tailoring Shop.

344
00:35:41,860 --> 00:35:44,290
It's made of
imported German Kongshi woolen cloth.

345
00:35:44,290 --> 00:35:45,150
Come, try it on.

346
00:35:46,820 --> 00:35:47,490
Let me.

347
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:52,920
My wife secretly saved some money.

348
00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:56,920
She said you have the most standard figure
in all of Shanghai.

349
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:01,620
If you weren't my apprentice,

350
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:04,210
I'd call you my brother-in-law right now.

351
00:36:06,990 --> 00:36:08,050
I like it very much.

352
00:36:08,070 --> 00:36:08,760
Thank you.

353
00:36:09,110 --> 00:36:09,910
You look good.

354
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:11,990
Here.

355
00:36:12,250 --> 00:36:12,850
Here.

356
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:16,520
Here.

357
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:23,030
Is Jinbao doing well?

358
00:36:25,630 --> 00:36:26,480
She is.

359
00:36:28,070 --> 00:36:29,130
She misses you too.

360
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,640
I've always wanted to go see her,

361
00:36:33,120 --> 00:36:34,530
but Du just won't let me.

362
00:36:35,740 --> 00:36:36,570
We agreed

363
00:36:37,340 --> 00:36:38,740
when we were kids

364
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:40,500
that in the future,

365
00:36:41,030 --> 00:36:42,430
we would be the godmother

366
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,280
of each other's kids.

367
00:36:47,190 --> 00:36:48,480
I can't see her now,

368
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:51,320
but I also made her a new outfit.

369
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:53,140
When the time is right,

370
00:36:53,420 --> 00:36:55,480
find an excuse to give it to her for me.

371
00:36:55,960 --> 00:36:56,590
Okay.

372
00:37:05,900 --> 00:37:06,830
Hurry up and eat.

373
00:37:10,030 --> 00:37:11,070
We were so busy talking

374
00:37:11,070 --> 00:37:12,930
that we forgot our main business.

375
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:16,000
Kailai,

376
00:37:16,710 --> 00:37:17,550
later,

377
00:37:17,910 --> 00:37:20,040
take a family photo for the three of us.

378
00:37:20,710 --> 00:37:22,480
I only trust you to do it.

379
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:24,520
Okay.

380
00:37:29,590 --> 00:37:30,440
Smile.

381
00:37:32,350 --> 00:37:32,990
Come on.

382
00:37:36,680 --> 00:37:37,720
Let's try a different pose.

383
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:38,550
A different pose.

384
00:37:38,550 --> 00:37:39,360
Okay.

385
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:40,440
I'll be here.

386
00:37:40,930 --> 00:37:41,640
Like this.

387
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:42,710
Okay.

388
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:51,670
For you.

389
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:01,510
Remember,

390
00:38:02,550 --> 00:38:03,480
when using a gun,

391
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:07,040
the most important thing is stability.

392
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:08,930
You must be steady, accurate, ruthless,

393
00:38:08,930 --> 00:38:10,090
and fast.

394
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:14,000
Do you know what fast is?

395
00:38:15,190 --> 00:38:16,150
Striking fast.

396
00:38:20,550 --> 00:38:22,210
There's another kind of fast:

397
00:38:23,710 --> 00:38:25,840
striking first to gain the upper hand.

398
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:32,670
Got it.

399
00:38:34,190 --> 00:38:36,320
Striking first to gain the upper hand.

400
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:43,030
If you shoot me,

401
00:38:43,560 --> 00:38:47,020
you'll be considered to have completed
your apprenticeship.

402
00:39:11,090 --> 00:39:15,050
♪ She is in the bloom of youth ♪

403
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:18,490
♪ The bloom of youth ♪

404
00:39:19,050 --> 00:39:22,800
♪ With arched brows and big eyes ♪

405
00:39:22,030 --> 00:39:23,440
We've been tracking

406
00:39:22,820 --> 00:39:26,180
♪ Big eyes ♪

407
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,640
Du Huangqiao's whereabouts recently.

408
00:39:26,960 --> 00:39:30,560
♪ Her lips are red,
her teeth pearly white ♪

409
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:29,610
And we finally found his place.

410
00:39:30,760 --> 00:39:34,120
♪ Pearly white ♪

411
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:33,630
Guess

412
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:37,190
♪ Her rose-red smile ♪

413
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,400
who we saw.

414
00:39:37,330 --> 00:39:42,020
♪ Her rose-red smile
outshines the evening glow ♪

415
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:43,150
Can you believe it?

416
00:39:42,980 --> 00:39:53,990
♪ Oh, she is in the bloom of youth ♪

417
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:46,520
Yang Xiaoxian isn't dead at all.

418
00:39:54,380 --> 00:39:58,450
♪ The bloom of youth ♪

419
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:56,070
Not only is she alive,

420
00:39:57,670 --> 00:40:00,070
she's pregnant with Du Huangqiao's child.

421
00:40:06,220 --> 00:40:09,940
♪ She is in the bloom of youth ♪

422
00:40:10,160 --> 00:40:13,580
♪ The bloom of youth ♪

423
00:40:13,950 --> 00:40:17,740
♪ Every man wants her ♪

424
00:40:18,070 --> 00:40:21,680
♪ All want her ♪

425
00:40:22,090 --> 00:40:25,790
♪ She won't fall for poor guys ♪

426
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:25,800
What's so funny?

427
00:40:25,890 --> 00:40:29,290
♪ Poor guys ♪

428
00:40:29,860 --> 00:40:32,290
♪ She won't marry ♪

429
00:40:30,590 --> 00:40:32,840
Don't you think we're all a joke?

430
00:40:32,310 --> 00:40:37,600
♪ She won't marry a rich old man ♪

431
00:40:37,770 --> 00:40:49,150
♪ Oh, she is in the bloom of youth ♪

432
00:40:48,180 --> 00:40:49,350
She must die.

433
00:40:49,410 --> 00:40:53,400
♪ The bloom of youth ♪

434
00:41:18,380 --> 00:41:20,550
My father's funeral is over.

435
00:41:22,280 --> 00:41:23,810
Once I sort out the factory,

436
00:41:25,260 --> 00:41:26,720
I'll be leaving Shanghai.

437
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:32,590
Why didn't you ask me this time

438
00:41:33,710 --> 00:41:34,970
if I want to go with you?

439
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:40,230
I'm short on money now.

440
00:41:41,030 --> 00:41:43,160
I'm afraid I can't give you a good life.

441
00:41:55,230 --> 00:41:56,320
Leaving here

442
00:41:57,230 --> 00:41:58,840
might not be a bad thing.

443
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:15,600
Xiaoxian?

444
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:27,510
Hello.

445
00:42:28,170 --> 00:42:29,080
It's me.

446
00:42:30,960 --> 00:42:32,090
Where have you been?

447
00:42:35,880 --> 00:42:36,630
Captain Du.

448
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:45,630
Whether she and the baby in her belly

449
00:42:45,630 --> 00:42:46,880
can survive

450
00:42:47,810 --> 00:42:48,810
depends on you.

451
00:42:51,960 --> 00:42:52,890
What do you want?

452
00:42:56,380 --> 00:42:58,420
You have a few of my men.

453
00:43:00,020 --> 00:43:01,430
Bring them here to exchange for her.
